# Boosthis kit: keep every file in this folder exactly as it was shipped.
#
# The kit's files are checked byte for byte against its signed release list.
# Git can rewrite line endings when it checks files out or in (on Windows it
# usually does, through core.autocrlf), which changes those bytes and fails
# the check. This tells Git never to convert line endings here, either way.
* -text
